[[size 111%]]8336 **External Addendum**[[/size]]



------



    As it doesn't really fit in within the rest of the main SCP-8336 document, I'm creating this as a separate file. Consider it supplementary "recordkeeping," or something like that.



    The situation at Site-243 got pretty hectic after Barker's death, especially since we're required to send log transcriptions through the censorship process, ultimately headed by the Director; obviously, no longer alive. It's primarily just an arbitrary confirmation system, but we couldn't even get the document published until Shea eventually picked up the position of Director. Then, of course, the whole case surrounding Carl Moore immediately had the building knee-deep in busywork from investigative departments. That took a while to deal with.



    But, even after this had all passed, the networking office sent out a report concerning the online SCP-8336 page. There was an irregularity, they said. Someone had edited the UI, adding a new Foundation insignia and subheader, and they couldn't change it back to normal ([http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/local--files/8336-external-addendum/strange.png See here]).



    So, we promptly deleted the image file. That didn't change anything. We briefly reset the entire district server, and that didn't change anything, either. Once we started digging a little deeper, looking into the user who made the edit, the networking office told us to back off, barring our usual permissions. 

    	

    Now, honestly, I don't care about whatever happened to Barker. Just another horror to write up and submit, same as the rest. Site-243 isn't for detectives. Does that make this any less disconcerting, though? It's already late July, and no office or department has reached back to us on fixing the page. It may not be dangerous, but shouldn't it at least fall under RAISA's jurisdiction? 



    Although, I guess that's all just personal commentary. Closing off for now, as nothing much else has happened since the UI edit.



[[div style="float: left; text-size: 105%;"]]

**//[https://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-8336 View previous?]//**

[[/div]]

[[div style="text-align:right;"]]

- Sienna Graham, Site-243

July 28, 2009

[[/div]]

